{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UG5fvHMWj67mMFLpBdJRvw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:49.579333+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UG5fvHMWj67mMFLpBdJRvw","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iaIgbtJmPO3Y7R4KK2fqMlfN292omcvy5HffpUuVlLDqibwibiajjgFBuib0SkvvsDL719XnOX6IdVWGMAAlkXTKW6Q/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaIgbtJmPO3YfrRIy13lQlmD4MuiaQYFGAb47VGGqOwOBtwTNUTCDYbRtSpKYD9WjpwnlTQPccic50bDmd1jBq9mg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>文学与艺术学院于2005年合并组建而成，设有中文系、新闻系、设计系、音乐系。学院现设有中国语言文学1个学术型硕士点和国际中文教育、设计、音乐3个专业硕士学位点。依托教育部国别与区域研究培育基地——拉美研究中心，设有四川网络文学发展研究中心、四川文艺评论研究中心、中华传统文化学院庞中华书法教育研究院、西南各民族文学与文献研究中心等省校级特色研究平台。同时，还组建了“数字媒体时代文学与社会研究”创新团队、四川藏羌彝走廊语言文化接触研究团队、中国传统音乐科研创新团队3个校级科研团队，形成了多层次、多维度的学科发展格局。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院现有教职工115人，教工党员53人，正高级职称13人，副高级职称23人，博士率达32%。教师队伍中有省学术和技术带头人、省学术与技术带头人后备人选、天府青城计划社科菁英、省本科教学指导委员会、省级教学名师、优秀专家、省市政府津贴获得者、曾宪梓教育奖励基金获得者、省优秀教师、省人民政府教学成果奖、巴蜀文艺奖、省文艺评论奖、中国音乐金钟奖、绵州文化名家等获得者多名。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院科研实力强劲，近十年来，承担国家社科基金《清代四川南部县司法档案方言研究》《全球化语境中的网络文学海外传播与中国经验研究》《明清赴日禅僧手迹的整理与研究》等20余项，教育部、四川省等省部级课题50余项，获得国家艺术基金资助2项，出版学术专著、教材等40余部，先后在《中国语文》《方言》等重要刊物上发表学术论文及原创艺术作品共1500余件（重要核心刊物400余篇），荣获四川省社会科学界优秀科研成果奖二等奖、三等奖多项，绵阳市社科联优秀成果奖一等奖等40余项。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>为向校内外优秀大学生提供相互交流学习的平台，增进全国各高校相关专业大学三年级优秀本科生及备考我院研究生对西南科技大学文艺学院中国语言文学与汉语国际教育硕士专业的认识和了解，文艺学院将选拔优秀本科生继续攻读硕士研究生，我院拟召开学术夏令营。现将具体事项通知如下：</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营时间和方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>夏令营将于2025年6月21日至6月22日举行，通过线上方式开展学科前沿讲座、学术交流等活动。</span></span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营活动内容</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>夏令营将开展学科介绍、学术讲座、导师见面会等丰富多彩的学术活动。在夏令营活动中，我院将安排营员参加学术能力考核，作为2025年西南科技大学文艺学院免试研究生选拔的重要参考和依据。（具体活动安排另行通知）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营营员申请资格</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.大学本科三年级在读学生，往届生凭毕业证书均可报名；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.学习成绩良好的同学；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.通过英语四级或六级、TOEFL、GRE/GMAT等考试者优先</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>04</span></strong><strong><span><br/></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请材料提交</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.申请表（附件1下载）；  </span></span></p><p><span><span>2.学生证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.身份证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.国家英语四、六级考试成绩或其他体现自身英语水平的证明1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人将申请表及相关材料的扫描件发送至邮3070037522@qq.com进行报名。邮件名备注：夏令营+所在学校+专业+姓名。报名截止日期为2025年6月15日，过时不再接收申请。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>拟申请加入的专业</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中国语言文学（文艺学、中国现当代文学、中国古代文学、汉语言文字学、语言学及应用语言学）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>汉语国际教育专业（汉语国际推广与中华文化传播、“中国-拉美”文化传播研究、跨文化交际研究）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>音乐（器乐、合唱指挥、声乐）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><span>设计（环境设计、城市设计、数字媒体艺术）</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>审核方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>审核和录取工作由西南科技大学文学与艺术学院组织专门工作小组负责。审核录取工作将于6月18日前结束，录取名单将于6月19日前直接通知本人（以电子邮件或电话通知）。届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><sec